+	  Note that the driver cannot validate what a command means, because it
+	  does not know any application's payload format: anyone who can open
+	  the client device may send arbitrary commands to any loaded trusted
+	  application. Restrict access to the device nodes accordingly. See
+	  Documentation/tee/qseecom.rst.
